REM EXPERIMENT 5: Create a Basic GitHub Actions Workflow
REM Step 1: Clone your GitHub repository (run only if not already cloned)
git clone https://github.com/sivapriyakumar246-cyber/GitExperiment1.git

REM Step 2: Enter the repository folder
cd GitExperiment1

REM Step 3: Check the repository status
git status

REM Step 4: Create the folder for GitHub Actions workflow
mkdir .github\workflows

REM Step 5: Open Notepad to create the workflow file
notepad .github\workflows\main.yml

REM In Notepad, paste the following YAML, save with Ctrl+S, and close Notepad:
